    "body": "Classification (labels to be applied by a session with write access):\n\n- bug: a user-hit wrong behaviour (parallel test failures).\n- P3: wrong behaviour with a workaround (run the ui --lib suite serially).\n- area:ui: camcraft-ui crate, law_tests.rs colour-scan suites.\n- effort:medium: one crate, a known pattern (guard the process-global\n  theme / colour-vision cells like snapshot_guard() already does in the\n  structural tests).\n- source:agent: filed by an agent during the #1696 report-button work.\n\nLabels are set per AGENTS.md Issue Law; this session cannot set labels on\nNeoTech/Camcraft (FlamingFireCoding has push:false). A collaborator's\nsession can apply the five labels above, then the issue is pickable in the\nbug lane.\n",
